# Build output, the sidecar binary a build copies in, and what tauri-build regenerates on every build
# (the ACL schemas, and the allow-/deny- permissions for the commands build.rs declares). None of it
# is source.
/src-tauri/target/
/src-tauri/binaries/
/src-tauri/gen/
/src-tauri/permissions/autogenerated/
